Package: waservix
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'WAservix' 'WhatsApp' API Gateway
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joseph", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "niyogushimwaj967@gmail.com"),
    person("Tekservix", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Client for the 'WAservix' 'WhatsApp' API Gateway <https://tekservix.com/waservix>,
    which sends 'WhatsApp' messages from your own number connected by QR code.
    Send texts, images, documents and locations to numbers and groups, check
    message status, edit, delete and resend messages, check whether a number uses
    'WhatsApp', list contacts and groups, and verify webhook deliveries.
    A 'Tekservix' account with 'WAservix' and a device API key are required.
